  m_Name: flamethrower_GunData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Liquid  Fire
  descriptionEnglish: '"Liquid Fire" is a powerful flamethrower that unleashes streams
    of blazing inferno, reducing demons to ash in seconds. Surprisingly, demons,
    despite being from hell and surrounded by fire, take significant damage from
    fire-based weapons. This makes the "Liquid Fire" an ideal weapon for demon hunters.'
  nameChinese: "\u706B\u7130\u55B7\u5C04\u5668"
  descriptionChinese: "\u706B\u7130\u55B7\u5C04\u5668\u662F\u4E00\u79CD\u5F3A\u5927\u7684\u706B\u7130\u55B7\u5C04\u5668\uFF0C\u55B7\u5C04\u51FA\u70BD\u70ED\u7684\u706B\u7130\uFF0C\u4EC5\u51E0\u79D2\u949F\u5C31\u80FD\u5C06\u6076\u9B54\u5316\u4E3A\u7070\u70EC\u3002\u4EE4\u4EBA\u60CA\u8BB6\u7684\u662F\uFF0C\u5C3D\u7BA1\u6076\u9B54\u6765\u81EA\u5730\u72F1\u5E76\u88AB\u706B\u6240\u5305\u56F4\uFF0C\u4F46\u5B83\u4EEC\u5BF9\u57FA\u4E8E\u706B\u7130\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u4F1A\u53D7\u5230\u663E\u8457\u4F24\u5BB3\u3002\u8FD9\u4F7F\u5F97\u706B\u7130\u55B7\u5C04\u5668\u6210\u4E3A\u730E\u6740\u6076\u9B54\u8005\u7684\u7406\u60F3\u6B66\u5668\u3002"
  namePortuguese: "Fogo l\xEDquido"
  descriptionPortuguese: "um lan\xE7a-chamas poderoso que libera correntes de inferno
    ardente, reduzindo dem\xF4nios a cinzas em segundos. Surpreendentemente, os dem\xF4nios,
    apesar de serem do inferno e cercados por fogo, sofrem danos significativos de
    armas baseadas em fogo. Isso torna o \"Fogo L\xEDquido\" uma arma ideal para
    ca\xE7adores de dem\xF4nios."
  nameSpanish: "Fuego l\xEDquido"
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "\u201CFuego l\xEDquido\u201D es un lanzallamas poderoso
    que libera corrientes de fuego infernal, reduciendo a los demonios a cenizas
    en cuesti\xF3n de segundos. Sorprendentemente, los demonios, a pesar de ser del
    infierno y estar rodeados de fuego, sufren da\xF1o significativo de las armas
    basadas en fuego. Esto hace que el \u201CFuego l\xEDquido\u201D sea un arma ideal
    para los cazadores de demonios."
